-- Replace the About-page biography with the approved Enterprise Support Organization description.
UPDATE site_content
SET content = 'E-Nyagasambu is a Digital Decentralized Marketplace and Enterprise Support Organization (ESO) designed to strengthen the capacity, market access, visibility, and growth of entrepreneurs, MSMEs, farmers, service providers, and emerging businesses. Through its digital platform, E-Nyagasambu connects enterprises directly with customers, suppliers, brokers, investors, and strategic partners, enabling them to showcase their products and services, access new markets, generate leads, facilitate transactions, and build sustainable business relationships. Its decentralized approach extends enterprise support beyond a single physical location by leveraging digital technology and community-based networks to reach businesses and entrepreneurs across Rwanda and, progressively, regional markets. E-Nyagasambu''s core proposition is simple: “Meet Your Clients, Expand Your Opportunities.”'
WHERE content_key = 'about.intro_1';

UPDATE site_content
SET content = 'As an ESO, E-Nyagasambu goes beyond providing an online marketplace by supporting enterprises throughout their business growth journey. It facilitates business registration and onboarding, tax advisory, digitalization, market linkages, customer acquisition, business promotion, brokerage and networking, access to finance and investment opportunities, business information, mentorship linkages, and capacity-building opportunities through partnerships with relevant ecosystem actors. The platform is intended to help enterprises move from simply having products or business ideas to becoming more visible, market-oriented, investment-ready, and capable of creating sustainable income and employment. By bringing together entrepreneurs, buyers, suppliers, financial institutions, investors, business support organizations, and community-based agents within one connected ecosystem, E-Nyagasambu contributes to building a more inclusive and accessible entrepreneurial environment where enterprises can find clients, access opportunities, improve their competitiveness, and grow sustainably.'
WHERE content_key = 'about.intro_2';
